@startuml
title UC-011 Back up and restore — collaboration
boundary BackupDefaults
control BackupPlugin
control RestorePlugin
entity Node
BackupDefaults --> BackupPlugin : 1: include or not
BackupPlugin --> Node : 2: read the nodes of the context
BackupDefaults --> RestorePlugin : 3: restore or not
RestorePlugin --> Node : 4: save the nodes of the context restored
@enduml
